208	The minimum equivalence margin achieving 80\% power at $n = 87$ is $\Delta = 15.7$pp; at $\Delta = 10$pp TOST is underpowered (power $\approx 42\%$), and a tighter margin requires larger $n$ (\S\ref{sec:limitations}).
